WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.165
Read the video transcript The four cards show alternative

00:00:03.218 --> 00:00:07.587
responses not a sequence you must follow Start with

00:00:07.613 --> 00:00:12.074
the specific action and its actual delegation Act within

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.600
permission and conditions otherwise seek approval refer or decline

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.837
and escalate The first example card has a fictional

00:00:20.876 --> 00:00:26.508
two-thousand-rand limit This is a meeting-consumables ordering limit not

00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:30.350
payment authority Do not split an order to evade

00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:34.482
the limit The two privacy cards emphasise the minimum

00:00:34.508 --> 00:00:39.784
information necessary and the approved recipient Decline an unauthorised

00:00:39.824 --> 00:00:42.784
request for the full private diary and explain the

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.640
boundary through the approved route
